{
  "5": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:218d6d859821faa84804b24790ada082c6de46b88e7348e1a961969b284496c9",
      "text": "My thanks to Lord Fang. Politics\nwould never permit me an audience\nwith the king in my present state.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "9": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7ff7e212354517557fed6407e1f130aecee85ca634a14571708daa7aff9cc6d5",
      "text": "It just shows how little influence\nthe king has left. No thanks needed.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "11": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:228a66331a3f35c1ec1d865ea6eafc0c10664248a52b3e3050a43dbaf2fde649",
      "text": "But he doesn't have the capacity to\ntake in your feelings, Lord Zahn.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "15": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9bb6647d11544831771f4d3585e8414790a6816d58f624f137966a1d11ff18a3",
      "text": "...Even so, I will believe.\nIn my king.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "19": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:be7de494674874799b52fb6ac2eef38cf0ed5dd85a3e1110453694c0753df128",
      "text": "Eh, let him try it.\nThough I think it's pointless too.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "24": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:86575e4298cac58b39629231ba69bf5647606adb7c3d13faa3e77a4e45ef1e3a",
      "text": "...Very well. But there's the\neffect on the nobles to consider.\nI will sit in on the audience.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "29": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:05f8cb0fff41f5c1e99e0eb5215067386a2e036401ac0c81f47b37658ee9fd42",
      "text": "I am grateful.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "35": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f08bef3a2b7c2429515e79fe44f9dabfcc960aac7c166fb87225dbdd4227db20",
      "text": "Rolf Zahn.\nI thank you for this audience.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "39": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e638afb5caf114e6f4839888d636949ac79626f997e1bd356404cc26797cf538",
      "text": "...It has been a while.\nShow me what face you dare wear\nbefore me.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "43": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:aab2442eebf6d524474e7400f8f32629b029d9c85ab671f3e3487b3394c9428b",
      "text": "Your Majesty.\nToday I have come to present\nmy petition.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "47": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:069332d27696486ef33908ed346f637109e898c0afb628f32d3c6535301340c3",
      "text": "...Very well.\nI shall hear out the ravings of an\ningrate.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "51": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1fb812d5d2b53da3249b05527209796b9a79a219e6caba9c6e0b414adbc48edd",
      "text": "Yes, sire. A town in a distant land\nis in peril at this very moment.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "54": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8987c8ecb3c7a4db8189d9c66e42fa88da71c6dc242bc9bff6712fe6a00fca52",
      "text": "Please permit me, as the 'King's\nSword,' to fight for the people.\nTo protect all your subjects.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "58": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c4911e57132218418731396733ee9e1a675d238f38e9d71047efa067f06353f3",
      "text": "What... are you saying...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "61": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f0f3f815e066def6b961672ec9820945d2a3092e6f0d0978013e7b375b751f57",
      "text": "That town is a miracle,\nwhere different races live\ntogether and laugh together.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "63": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c7b23e797746631a517523b3ab892943ce54ed88eab9baca61d073e7b4506380",
      "text": "In your name, I will protect its\npeople and atone for our sins.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "66": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0f54fafd4ea3ddb2258b0172e86c3308b4149773d81b1f7fb393290f833e7cf3",
      "text": "If the chance arises, I hope one day\nyou will see that town, Your Majesty.\nAnd that you will find in your heart—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "71": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a299451b3718686e0467f559058a5a46d54a3c054387d028411cc63d3b4130cc",
      "text": "What sins!!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "75": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:338a43e0c2d88f6aa3ad2b4a92ee3512cfe26cdf757253c12879e0ba0719a013",
      "text": "I have done good deeds!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "79": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:20a5b81e9eccd2363735a32c3ba66747134479be12571cc30400414f3308ff2f",
      "text": "I drove out the White Tiger!\nI made the dogfolk SUPREME!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "82": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:66ad1431908b95f63295cb73cdf337e5b8ea87716ec0168eecc3a4bf78702d8f",
      "text": "If you had slaughtered every cat, we\nwould never have fallen to this\ndisgrace!!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "86": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d6268f6cd96cc30757e2d02e9053f953776fa78964e218ea306756fcf9bd1647",
      "text": "...To think... he is this blind...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "91": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:728d934a7f9b60ddf07437d088b20c549a8137616b31aa45c7e1e549c81de059",
      "text": "...Your Majesty.\nPlease, calm yourself.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "98": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9e8a5114532a023d851cafc1bcff8e44ae7eecb8fabed3a447eeb162e0901ef1",
      "text": "What do you say, you\ndisloyal wretch!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "102": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:10cad22ea53aed16297bf201a816522ec43b57dbbd48213919f59fb48bf52813",
      "text": "You object? But it's the truth! A\ntruly loyal man would have stopped\nme with remonstrance long ago!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "106": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:41a8d1e466c27685e777c214258348f815c5a0ea90c8ebdceeed45651b46b92f",
      "text": "...I have no reply...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "111": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:73e234e7fc4a127d441eda7062e4ac5a4ce14c621209ac179368f0bba1a846c1",
      "text": "It is ALL your fault! There are\nno sins for me to atone for!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "116": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1794948f7c58069fa3d3f9b4cc3c7a7e8b5487fa03f493016eea2849d942d015",
      "text": "............\nMy blindness is complete.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "120": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:16b6330a623c176273fe2cd4b78620114f93d724a71fe5de52513cf62eb25c6b",
      "text": "The sword I dedicated to you.\nI return it here.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "123": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1f47acdd8d18a4e58f4efedc136d63e91cc5d149c7c570be044557c8f72fcaf3",
      "text": "If it displeases you, then\ncut me down.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "129": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7b802d8b45d67efdee17da89d0570fa530c7b0b6e3a80620ca29df3091d81609",
      "text": "No, Lord Zahn!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "133": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5c86c055a7bc27437f2b068bbd37150f6f8c621ed895c17234ca0b7ef121de29",
      "text": "Your Majesty.\nWhat becomes of you, choose yourself.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "139": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4b4893ec0984b77d01077899f2bb387519e7b9480128b61bde882634386da0a2",
      "text": "Y-you... you wretch...! Now you\nput on the face of loyalty...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "143": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ecbfb4f80076033f32973dc7acbdfefe0847add2b09e0ea8fbf2b3a162a0d3dc",
      "text": "That neck of yours!\nI'll cut it down, as you wish!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "148": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b0bb05c05ce522710dc6cfb97e067e383ab4b22abcfec8e4d59fb380ea8e7aac",
      "text": "...The king's sword proved too heavy\nfor that man.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "152": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f8ca637e5a5d6589a341627ffd356776e88e3f4897d83e7d53018398227dfca3",
      "text": "My loyalty... these twenty years and\nmore... all... an illusion...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "155": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:74ce658e49296f8d0296b8305f1e9e54978605bfd4dc45e4e6b167494c80c824",
      "text": "............I was............\n...a fool...............",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "160": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6866e5df6277d020cd3d6034daba2fbacfee953a11399d17e24ff8d06da3ac3c",
      "text": "Sorry to keep you waiting.\nThank you for your consideration.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "164": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:029c8a527a75d021fbead84cb4f4006bd0998ae431a3dc9ce5331fee802acf09",
      "text": "Are you done?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "167": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f356158b97ef2717a5d6b1500630a5b3aaf2e50c63678cc06898b23401824e00",
      "text": "What is there to say, now\nit has come to this?\n...Gerda knew everything.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "170": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:103cd1bfa2023d843c0111bfdae242376d9668a078e1f5e65d0182248f4a9f8d",
      "text": "She knew the folly of one who\nnever admonished the king about a\nfutile war, but fled into battle.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "172": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fa1eb426b43a1a54fe7bae1730c4393d75f7d71bfd00bd843d05624ee248a3fa",
      "text": "Who knew of the coup plot and neither\nstopped it nor joined it. That folly.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "176": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0a7e4d4ce0c58c4edc71eb84a5f2be073b0c1024547b1bc0c68d7ced91f9037b",
      "text": "And she stayed with you to the\nvery end. She was something else.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "180": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9637ef0f2a73cddd242a4a3a24d6a06e2af673773d9f3025786b4ee939d7f934",
      "text": "A wife too good for me, and my pride.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "184": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:da76e74d3c0a0a2ad748380c534e2787eef74a7c17182eb8baf6c00a69a733d2",
      "text": "Lord Fang, Lord Navel.\nWould you accept even the\nsword of a fool like me?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "188": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c2bdd2211f1685089a7594acd44c1f741b382e16bf5b3a0cad734fa9ea5ea950",
      "text": "Neither Claw nor I am king.\nRight?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "193": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:17ff968fda7909c93be748dbe6566af336757b8e7ee346200ce30907899c30b0",
      "text": "We're comrades, after all! No need\nto be so stiff about it!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "198": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0b0c46d4a6a71ee0cfdca7ff8022108991be528c8a4aa19ff265fa45a8f66b9a",
      "text": "And isn't your new battlefield\nsomewhere other than here?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "203": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ab6aaf233eba63f2e08b18a4be852b8325f7dc4fde88384f580bc1c0b8b22897",
      "text": "Forgive me. A bad habit sunk into the\nbone is not easily shaken.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "206": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b6a84d43d56d8f6fa26a24d731ddeada315118cde82cbe9ec09a494c3ba56cbd",
      "text": "Gerda, we part for a time. I may make\nyou lonely. Forgive me.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "210": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ed63e749005b1b3779fb4f2ed408eb1e0c200107f1306d4f3ea6b6d783c9c312",
      "text": "...Rest easy.\nI will not err again.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "217": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0c7a2073d233e1bdc55ed1c0f589ba09c370d330eff6809a11a6797231fde705",
      "text": "You! Quit messing around!!!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "221": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0bffe208a5adbed924f9d61b15545855f14a7b8edc9d489d46d90a56a74b3abf",
      "text": "How strange. I would never jest in\nthe presence of a superior officer.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "223": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8c40f84764ab437017708273f07a72622861201424d184ac55f397e07f88dd72",
      "text": "Rolf Zahn, new recruit. Twenty years\non every army front. I am rather\nconfident with powder.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "229": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fd80b99300011209270ff07a1b0b5ad2da77848b6d06584afd855b5e1a60e1aa",
      "text": "That's exactly why! What\nis that, if not a joke!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "232": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:110c01ee6207d64567527df85f3e7a3a0edfe071a870e203e6fc92913e715269",
      "text": "I had heard that in the Company of\nthe Fang, all begin again as common\nsoldiers regardless of past service.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "237": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:787a0e19f9b056f9d2c4e4a46d94ead6f09fc950095c82fdb61016bf2f097226",
      "text": "If we put you next to the\nBlack Wolf, the others\nwould be too intimidated.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "240": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b5e2c1d7088fd9f06b5cc8de31423ce7e7af25ea43c7ffc3bc42e181a5e2d1b2",
      "text": "You'll be treated as a guest officer.\nWe're short on commanders.\nI'm counting on you.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "243": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a43bce1d01d803c17fd2e9e91a5eee10ca4c7336d2ce2a9b4f9d26b830dbdf9b",
      "text": "Understood. I shall fight with all my\nheart and soul, to protect that city.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "245": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:715c63af7481eb38d55dca9279f183251e7b3517fb867042d3e15f9e35beaf8e",
      "text": "For the sake of the\npath I believe in.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
